.TH LIBMPQ__FILE_WRITE 3 2026-08-18 "The MoPaQ archive library"
.SH NAME
libmpq__file_write \- write bytes to a streamed MPQ file
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B #include <libmpq/mpq.h>
.PP
.B int32_t libmpq__file_write(mpq_writer_s *writer, const uint8_t *buffer, libmpq__off_t size);
.SH DESCRIPTION
Appends bytes to the writer returned by libmpq__file_begin(3). Writes beyond
the declared unpacked size are rejected.
